WEBVTT

00:00:02.172 --> 00:00:04.372
Oh! Hi, Buzz!

00:00:04.452 --> 00:00:07.492
Why don't you say hello
to the guys over there?

00:00:07.572 --> 00:00:11.292
(AS BUZZ) Hiya, fellas!
To infinity and beyond!

00:00:11.372 --> 00:00:13.252
Hey, look! It's Buzz!

00:00:13.292 --> 00:00:18.212
Hey, Buzz, let's show the guys
our new secret best friends handshake.

00:00:18.292 --> 00:00:19.652
Give me five, man!

00:00:19.732 --> 00:00:20.932
Something's screwy here.

00:00:20.972 --> 00:00:23.852
So you see we're friends now, guys.
Aren't we, Buzz?

00:00:23.932 --> 00:00:25.812
(AS BUZZ) You bet.
Give me a hug.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:28.372
Ho-ho! Boy, I love you too.

00:00:28.452 --> 00:00:30.092
See? It is Buzz.

00:00:30.132 --> 00:00:33.332
-Now give back the lights, Potato Head.
-Wait just a minute.

00:00:33.372 --> 00:00:35.612
-What are you tryin' to pull?
-Nothing!

00:00:35.652 --> 00:00:38.652
-(SCREAMING)
-(GROUP MURMURING)

00:00:38.692 --> 00:00:40.252
(GRUNTS, RETCHES)

00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:41.972
-Oh, that is disgusting.
-Murderer!

00:00:42.052 --> 00:00:44.172
-No! No, no, no, no, no!
-You murdering dog!

00:00:44.212 --> 00:00:46.612
-It's not what you think. I swear!
-Save it for the jury.

00:00:46.652 --> 00:00:49.292
I hope Sid pulls
your voice box out, ya creep.

00:00:49.332 --> 00:00:51.252
No, no! No, no!
Don't leave! Don't leave!

00:00:51.332 --> 00:00:54.292
Ya gotta help us, please! You don't
know what it's like over here!

00:00:54.332 --> 00:00:55.732
Come on.
Let's get outta here.

00:00:55.812 --> 00:00:58.412
Go back to your lives, citizens.
Show's over.

00:00:58.492 --> 00:01:01.092
WOODY: Come back! Slink!

00:01:01.172 --> 00:01:05.132
Slink! Please!
Please! Listen to me!

00:01:05.172 --> 00:01:08.492
No! No! Come back!

00:01:08.532 --> 00:01:11.132
Slinky!

00:01:11.732 --> 00:01:13.732
(THUNDER RUMBLING)

00:01:15.052 --> 00:01:17.972
(THUMPING, CLATTERING)

00:01:19.732 --> 00:01:22.252
Buzz! Go away!

00:01:22.332 --> 00:01:25.252
You disgusting freaks!
Aaah!

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:29.332
All right, back!
Back, you cannibals! Aah! Oof!

00:01:32.572 --> 00:01:36.252
He is still alive, and you're
not gonna get him, you monsters!

00:01:36.332 --> 00:01:38.132
What are you doin'?

00:01:41.052 --> 00:01:43.132
Hey. Hey, they fixed you.

00:01:46.732 --> 00:01:48.212
But-But they're cannibals.

00:01:48.292 --> 00:01:50.892
We saw them eat
those other toys.

00:01:55.732 --> 00:01:57.692
(QUACKS)

00:01:58.812 --> 00:02:01.772
Uh, sorry. I-I-I thought
that you were gonna...

00:02:02.252 --> 00:02:04.452
(CHUCKLES) You know,
you know, eat my friend.

00:02:04.732 --> 00:02:06.612
WOODY: Hey, no, no, wait, hey!

00:02:06.692 --> 00:02:08.132
-What's wrong?
-SID'S MOM: Sid?

00:02:08.212 --> 00:02:09.892
SID: Not now, Mom!
I'm busy!

00:02:09.972 --> 00:02:12.412
-Sid! Buzz, come on!
-MOM: You left that door open.

00:02:12.452 --> 00:02:16.892
Get up! Use your legs! Fine!
Let Sid trash you! But don't blame me!

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:22.412
It came!
It finally came!

00:02:22.532 --> 00:02:24.252
Ha, ha!

00:02:25.572 --> 00:02:27.252
"The Big One."

00:02:30.212 --> 00:02:32.692
"Extremely dangerous.

00:02:32.772 --> 00:02:35.492
"Keep out of reach of children."

00:02:36.772 --> 00:02:40.012
Cool!
What am I gonna blow?

00:02:40.092 --> 00:02:42.972
Man. Hey, where's
that wimpy cowboy doll?

00:02:53.252 --> 00:02:54.732
(BUZZ BUZZING)

00:02:57.332 --> 00:03:02.292
Yes. I've always wanted
to put a spaceman into orbit.

00:03:09.292 --> 00:03:12.012
-(TAPE UNREELING)
-SID: Heh, heh.

00:03:12.092 --> 00:03:14.212
Now. Yes.

00:03:14.572 --> 00:03:16.292
(SINISTER CHUCKLE)

00:03:17.132 --> 00:03:20.612
-(THUNDERCLAP)
-Oh, no!

00:03:21.572 --> 00:03:23.012
(THUNDER RUMBLING)

00:03:23.172 --> 00:03:24.812
Oh, man!

00:03:31.492 --> 00:03:33.252
Sid Phillips reporting.

00:03:33.332 --> 00:03:34.812
Launch of the shuttle
has been delayed

00:03:34.932 --> 00:03:37.652
due to adverse weather
conditions at the launch site.

00:03:37.692 --> 00:03:40.572
Tomorrow's forecast, sunny.

00:03:40.892 --> 00:03:43.812
(SINISTER CHUCKLE)
Sweet dreams.

00:03:47.852 --> 00:03:49.052
(FOOTFALLS APPROACHING)

00:03:49.132 --> 00:03:52.692
MOM: I looked everywhere, honey,
but all I could find was your hat.

00:03:52.732 --> 00:03:54.892
But what if we
leave them behind?

00:03:54.972 --> 00:03:56.772
Oh, don't worry, honey.

00:03:56.852 --> 00:04:00.292
I'm sure we'll find Woody and Buzz
before we leave tomorrow.

00:04:04.652 --> 00:04:07.772
(DOOR CREAKS, CLOSES)

00:04:07.852 --> 00:04:09.812
REX: (GASPS) I need air!

00:04:10.532 --> 00:04:12.052
Will you quit movin' around?

00:04:12.132 --> 00:04:15.692
I'm sorry. It's just that I get...
I get so nervous before I travel.

00:04:15.772 --> 00:04:18.252
How did I get stuck
with you as a moving buddy?

00:04:18.332 --> 00:04:20.492
Everyone else was picked.

00:04:21.212 --> 00:04:24.332
(SNORING)

00:04:27.172 --> 00:04:28.612
BO: Oh, Woody.

00:04:29.652 --> 00:04:33.492
If only you could see
how much Andy misses you.

00:04:36.292 --> 00:04:38.772
(THUNDER RUMBLING)

00:04:39.052 --> 00:04:41.732
(SNORING)

00:04:43.052 --> 00:04:45.412
(STRAINING)

00:04:45.892 --> 00:04:49.172
Psst. Psst! Hey, Buzz!

00:04:55.692 --> 00:04:59.572
Hey. Get over here and see if
you can get this toolbox off me.

00:05:02.252 --> 00:05:05.132
Oh, come on, Buzz, I...

00:05:05.212 --> 00:05:09.332
Buzz, I can't do this without you.
I need your help.

00:05:11.012 --> 00:05:14.252
I can't help.
I can't help anyone.

00:05:14.292 --> 00:05:17.172
Why, sure you can, Buzz.
You can get me outta here.

00:05:17.252 --> 00:05:20.612
Then I'll get that rocket off you, and
we'll make a break for Andy's house.

00:05:20.692 --> 00:05:24.212
Andy's house, Sid's house.
What's the difference?

00:05:24.292 --> 00:05:28.372
Oh, Buzz. You've had a big fall.
You must not be thinking clearly.

00:05:28.452 --> 00:05:31.892
No, Woody. For the first time
I am thinking clearly.

00:05:31.932 --> 00:05:34.652
You were right all along.
I'm not a Space Ranger.

00:05:34.732 --> 00:05:38.932
I'm just a toy, a stupid,
little, insignificant toy.

00:05:39.012 --> 00:05:40.292
Whoa, hey, wait a minute.

00:05:40.372 --> 00:05:43.812
Bein' a toy is a lot better
than bein' a, a Space Ranger.

00:05:43.892 --> 00:05:46.172
-Yeah, right.
-No, it is.

00:05:46.252 --> 00:05:49.332
Look, over in that house is a kid
who thinks you are the greatest.

00:05:49.412 --> 00:05:52.132
And it's not because
you're a Space Ranger, pal.

00:05:52.172 --> 00:05:56.052
It's because you're a toy.
You are his toy.

00:05:56.132 --> 00:05:57.732
But why would Andy want me?

00:05:57.812 --> 00:06:03.092
Why would Andy want you?
Look at you! You're a Buzz Lightyear.

00:06:03.132 --> 00:06:05.932
Any other toy would give up
his moving parts just to be you.

00:06:05.972 --> 00:06:09.532
You've got wings.
You glow in the dark. You talk!

00:06:09.612 --> 00:06:12.972
Your helmet does
that, that, that whoosh thing.

00:06:13.572 --> 00:06:16.172
You are a cool toy.

00:06:19.612 --> 00:06:22.492
As a matter of fact,
you're too cool.

00:06:23.092 --> 00:06:26.332
I mean, I mean, what chance
does a toy like me have

00:06:26.372 --> 00:06:29.732
against a Buzz Lightyear
action figure?

00:06:29.812 --> 00:06:32.372
All I can do is...

00:06:32.452 --> 00:06:36.892
VOICE BOX:
There's a snake in my boots.

00:06:36.972 --> 00:06:39.292
Why would Andy ever want
to play with me

00:06:39.332 --> 00:06:42.052
when he's got you?

00:06:42.852 --> 00:06:46.532
I'm the one that should be
strapped to that rocket.

00:06:51.452 --> 00:06:54.332
(BIRDS CHIRPING)

